{"id":"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-pair.md","title":"Pair","display":"df-pair — Pair","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pair","aliases":["58-df-pair","Pair"],"display":"df-pair — Pair","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pair</span><span>Pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pair — Pair"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span> (defined here; ordered pair)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pair} \\vdash (a,b)\\coloneqq \\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pair} \\vdash (a,b)\\coloneqq \\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pair: two-element tuple; Kuratowski definition encodes order in set structure</li>\n<li>Product: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\times B = \\{ (a,b) : a \\in A, b \\in B \\}\">\\(A \\times B = \\{ (a,b) : a \\in A, b \\in B \\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Alternative: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b) = \\{a, \\{a,b\\}\\}\">\\((a,b) = \\{a, \\{a,b\\}\\}\\)</span> also works (Wiener); Kuratowski most common</li>\n<li>Pairwise: operations defined coordinate-wise on pairs; generalization to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-tuples</li>\n<li>Equality and projections are downstream lemmas for the ordered-pair encoding.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pair} \\vdash (a,b)\\coloneqq \\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A \\times B = \\{ (a,b) : a \\in A, b \\in B \\}","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b) = \\{a, \\{a,b\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":834,"backlinks":[{"id":"22c421a655624500","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]])"},{"id":"9619f9eac9e07e87","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]])"},{"id":"6de07dc0376b92ce","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]])"},{"id":"ff0cb02ba14373e4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}$；有序对编码见 [[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]。"},{"id":"b56049ecb5df84b2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":